User-defined Themes Example
===========================

(1) Set the PYTHONPATH as follows:

setenv PYTHONPATH <repo_install_path>/projects/WxVis:<repo_install_path>/projects/WxVis/user_themes

(2) Execute the wxvis.py test application

cd <repo_install_path>/projects/WxVis/bin
python wxvis.py --theme usertheme

Please take a look at how this example uses a user-defined theme to inherit from the wxmapsclassicpub theme and add additional plots.
